{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜跟進宏福苑報告(一)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-10-30-13-03-36hVNAztf3.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：跟進宏福苑報告</p><p>政府公布宏福苑火災獨立委員會報告，並提出一系列問責及改革措施。這些措施的力度是否足夠？能否防止類似事件再次發生？</p><p>嘉賓：全國港澳研究會顧問譚耀宗</p><p></p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T06:05:28.106979+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T05:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T05:59:58.157526+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T05:59:58.157526+00:00","content_hash":"06e406f5a5eb780c63bfa1d651193227e015e38d8fdb3c98f36a8f758760c20d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}